{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31033","headline":"酬曹侍御见寄 · 薛能","name":"酬曹侍御见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儒道苦不胜，迩来惟慕禅。\n触途非巧者，於世分沈然。\n要地羞难入，闲居钝更便。\n清和挑菜食，闷寂闭花眠。\n累遣期抛俸，机忘怕与权。\n妨春愁筦榷，响夜忆林泉。\n匪石从遭刖，殊膏枉被煎。\n讨论唯子厚，藏退合吾先。\n旧制羣英伏，来章六义全。\n休旬一拟和，乡思乱情田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}